We're keep working on the new content for Space Rogue. Today Space Rogue gets the minor 1.11 update with a few features:

"Buy all tritanium" button – now you can buy all tritanium ore at the stations in just one click;
Crew members tooltips – hover your or enemy's crew member to get the information;
Other minor changes and bugfixes.

Also, right now we're preparing a huge update for you. Details on it we will share in a couple of days, so stay tuned!

